# Materialisation manifest for the compiler-schema-fresh mutation fixture.
#
# check-compiler-schema-fresh.shs regenerates the registry from a HARDCODED set
# of enum sources (src/app/compiler_schema/registry.spl:38-49) and diffs it
# against spec/compiler_schema/registry/. A hand-written toy tree can therefore
# never exercise it: the generator would extract 0 variants and the gate would
# ERROR. So the baseline is the REAL artifact, copied read-only into a private
# scratch tree at run time. Paths are repo-relative; each is copied verbatim.
src/app/compiler_schema
src/compiler/10.frontend/ast.spl
src/compiler/10.frontend/parser_types_expr.spl
src/compiler/20.hir/hir_definitions.spl
src/compiler/20.hir/hir_types.spl
src/compiler/50.mir/mir_instruction_kinds.spl
src/compiler/50.mir/mir_instruction_support.spl
src/compiler/50.mir/mir_types.spl
spec/compiler_schema/registry
